2) Check that the server.N list in zoo.cfg is identical on every node — an inconsistent configuration is the most common cause of split brain;
3) Check connectivity and partitioning on ports 2888/3888 between nodes;
4) Once confirmed, stop the minority side so the cluster re-elects a leader, then bring those nodes back one at a time.
